mqvpn (0.19.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  The mqvpn deb is now three packages:

   * mqvpn: the client, libmqvpn.so.4, libxquic.so and the client examples.
   * mqvpn-server: mqvpn-server.service, the NAT helper and the server
     examples. On the first install, it creates a TLS certificate and
     /etc/mqvpn/server.conf if they are absent, and starts the server.
   * mqvpn-dev: the headers and the libmqvpn.so link. Install it together
     with the mqvpn deb of the same version.

  If you run mqvpn-server.service from the mqvpn package, also install
  mqvpn-server_<version>_<arch>.deb. Without it, this upgrade deletes the
  unit file. mqvpn-server keeps your /etc/mqvpn/server.conf, certificate
  and key.

  No package ships libmqvpn.a now. Link with -lmqvpn (libmqvpn.so).

